msgstr "Nyt i din fil"

#. Explanation of the "Added" line of the import result
msgid "New personas from your file."
msgstr "Nye personaer fra din fil."

#. Shown instead of a picture from the import file, which isn't loaded until it is stored on this server
msgid "New picture in the file, shown once imported"
msgstr "Nyt billede i filen, vises efter import"

#. Desktop app File menu item. Opens another app window showing the same place as the current one.
